AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0800465> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/mondo#rare>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0800465> "CTSC-related disorder")
