# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0859003> (PAICS deficiency)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "Orphanet:633099") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7638-4659") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0859003> "An inborn disorder of purine metabolism characterized by multiple congenital anomalies/dysmorphic features including craniofacial dysmorphism especially of the midface with flat face, low set ears, nasal hypoplasia, low nasal bridge, choanal atresia/stenosis and hypertelorism. Other malformations include, esophageal atresia with or without treacheoesophageal fistula, as well as malformations of ribs, lungs, vertebrae, legs, toes and fingers.")
